[["text","OOP / LESSON 39 OF 45"],["heading","39. UML Class Diagrams"],["text","English: UML class diagrams show classes, attributes, operations and relationships using"],["text","standard notation."],["sinhala","","සිංහල: Classes, fields, methods සහ relationships diagram එකකින් Jපන්වෙන ක්‍රමයක්.",432],["heading","Animal ◁── Dog (generalization); Order ◆── OrderLine (composition)"],["heading","Java example"],["code","class Animal { void eat() {} }"],["code","class Dog extends Animal { void bark() {} }"],["code","// UML: Dog points to Animal with a hollow triangle."],["text","Interview question: What does a filled diamond mean in a UML class diagram?"],["text","Answer: Composition; the diamond is at the owning whole. A hollow diamond denotes"],["text","aggregation."],["text","Remember: Animal ◁── Dog (generalization); Order ◆── OrderLine (composition)"]]